{title: Praise God, from Whom All Blessings Flow}
{artist: Thomas Ken (1637-1711)}
{key: G}
{copyright: Public Domain}

{sov: Verse 1}
[G]Praise God, from whom all [D]blessings flow;
[G]Praise Him, all creatures [Em]here be[D]low;
[G]Praise Him above, ye [C]heavenly [D]host;
[Em]Praise Father, Son, and [D]Holy [G]Ghost.
{eov}
